      "reason": "The obstacle is the operating system, not the GPU: bmengine's host runtime uses Linux POSIX APIs throughout (execinfo.h, sys/time.h, sched.h, pthread.h, sys/syscall.h), so it fails to build on Windows identically on every AMD card. Determined on windows-gfx1101 and confirmed host-wide on windows-gfx1201. Linux wave64 (gfx90a) and wave32 (gfx1100) both validated at head.",
